#: chaotic_pfc.cli.run_all:3 of
msgid ""
"Nested under ``chaotic-pfc run all``. Previously the top-level "
"``run_all.py`` script, which shelled out to each numbered script via "
"``subprocess``. The in-process version here is faster (no fork overhead, "
"the Numba cache is shared across experiments) and makes the control flow "
"much easier to follow."
msgstr ""
"Nested under ``chaotic-pfc run all``. Previously the top-level "
"``run_all.py`` script, which shelled out to each numbered script via "
"``subprocess``. The in-process version here is faster (no fork overhead, "
"the Numba cache is shared across experiments) and makes the control flow "
"much easier to follow."

